@startuml
title PolicyPal - Reset to Default Policy

skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "PolicyPal UI" as UI
participant "Policy API" as API
database "Policy Store" as Store

User -> UI : Click "Use Default Policy"
UI -> API : Reset policy

API -> Store : Clear uploaded policy
Store --> API : Default handbook active

API --> UI : Reset successful
UI --> User : Show default handbook

@enduml